{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have <strong>3 minutes</strong> to reach the end of the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813500/extras/STEAM_GIF_01-03-LIGHT.gif?t=1750485667\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have <strong>no arms</strong> and <strong>no legs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813500/extras/STEAM_GIF_02-02-LIGHT.gif?t=1750485667\" /></div>Will you find the strength and motivation to overcome your <strong>failures</strong>?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813500/extras/STEAM_GIF_05-02-LIGHT.gif?t=1750485667\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, <strong>it's okay to fail</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I <strong>fail</strong> every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 min to finish the demo</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>You'll need to learn the path and how to control the character to succeed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>If you fail, you start again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple gameplay</strong> (but difficult at first)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Press and release your arms/legs to jump.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rotate the character to move in the desired direction.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Its OK to Fail&quot; a challenging game inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with